"text":"RTL + accelerators"},{"text":"ML accelerator"}]]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A PG degree can be useful for specialization and research-heavy semiconductor roles."},{"type":"table","header":["PG Route","Relevant Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"M.Tech VLSI Design"},{"text":"Digital/ASIC design"}],[{"text":"M.Tech Microelectronics"},{"text":"Semiconductor devices and ICs"}],[{"text":"M.Tech Embedded Systems"},{"text":"Hardware + embedded systems"}],[{"text":"M.Tech Electronics"},{"text":"Advanced electronics"}],[{"text":"M.Tech Computer Engineering"},{"text":"Architecture + hardware"}],[{"text":"MS by Research"},{"text":"VLSI, architecture, semiconductor research"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Entrance Routes"},{"type":"h","text":"Potential routes include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GATE"},{"text":"institute-specific admissions"},{"text":"university-specific entrance examinations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"GATE Official Website","url":"https://gate2026.iitg.ac.in/"},{"type":"p","text":"Check the individual institute's eligibility and specialization requirements before applying."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Relevant master's fields include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"VLSI Design"},{"text":"Microelectronics"},{"text":"Semiconductor Engineering"},{"text":"Electrical & Computer Engineering"},{"text":"Computer Engineering"},{"text":"Integrated Circuit Design"},{"text":"Computer Architecture"},{"text":"Embedded Systems"}]},{"type":"table","header":["Country","Relevant Areas"],"rows":[[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"VLSI, Semiconductor, ECE, Computer Architecture"}],[{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Microelectronics, IC Design, Embedded Systems"}],[{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Semiconductor, ECE, Microelectronics"}],[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"VLSI, Semiconductor Engineering"}],[{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Computer/Electrical Engineering"}],[{"text":"France"},{"text":"Microelectronics, Embedded Systems"}],[{"text":"Japan"},{"text":"Semiconductor, Electronics, Computer Architecture"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Funding resources include:"},{"type":"p","text":"DAAD\nFulbright-Nehru Programs\nChevening","url":"https://www.daad.de/en/"}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"A possible technical progression:"},{"type":"flow","items":["VLSI Intern","Junior RTL / Verification Engineer","VLSI Design Engineer","Senior VLSI Engineer","Lead Design / Verification Engineer","Principal Engineer","VLSI / SoC Architect","Hardware Architect / Semiconductor Technical Leader"]},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative paths:"},{"type":"h","text":"RTL → CPU/SoC Architecture"},{"type":"h","text":"Verification → Verification Architecture"},{"type":"h","text":"VLSI → Physical Design"},{"type":"h","text":"VLSI → AI Accelerator Hardware"},{"type":"h","text":"VLSI → Hardware Security"}]},{"heading":"Long-Term Relevance: 2030–2046","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Potential Direction","Status"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"ASIC, FPGA, SoC, verification and semiconductor design"},{"text":"Foundation"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"AI accelerators, chiplets, advanced packaging and specialized compute"},{"text":"Check the official site"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Heterogeneous computing, advanced accelerators and domain-specific silicon"},{"text":"Check the official site"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"AI-native architectures, advanced semiconductor systems and specialized computing"},{"text":"Check the official site"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"The durable skill is not simply knowing Verilog."},{"type":"h","text":"It is the ability to understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Specification","Architecture","RTL","Verification","Synthesis","Timing","Physical Implementation","Silicon"]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Logic + Computer Architecture"},{"type":"h","text":"HDL"},{"type":"h","text":"Verilog + SystemVerilog"},{"type":"h","text":"Design"},{"type":"flow","items":["RTL","FSM","pipelining","interfaces"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Verification"},{"type":"flow","items":["Simulation","Assertions","UVM","Coverage"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"FPGA"},{"type":"flow","items":["FPGA architecture","timing","implementation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"ASIC"},{"type":"flow","items":["Synthesis","STA","Physical Design"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Architecture"},{"type":"flow","items":["RISC-V","SoC","memory systems","buses"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Tools"},{"type":"flow","items":["Verilator/Icarus","Yosys","OpenROAD","commercial EDA exposure where available"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"flow","items":["Chiplets","AI accelerators","hardware security","low-power design"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Final Portfolio Target"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, aim for 4–5 hardware projects:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ALU + digital logic project"},{"text":"UART/SPI/I²C controller"},{"text":"FIFO + memory subsystem"},{"text":"RISC-V processor or SoC"},{"text":"RTL-to-FPGA/ASIC flow project"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest final project should demonstrate:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Specification","Architecture","RTL","SystemVerilog Testbench","Verification","Synthesis","Timing Analysis","FPGA/ASIC Implementation"]},{"type":"p","text":"For a VLSI career, this evidence is much more valuable than simply listing “Verilog, VLSI and SystemVerilog” on a resume."}]}]}